kets this issue, as this is not account-specific. Thank you!\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":1,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false}],\"contentV1\":null},{\"afficheId\":45,\"title\":\"Clones, Duplicate accounts and Affiliate abuse.\",\"intro\":\"\",\"languageCode\":\"en-US\",\"createTime\":1743192221578,\"updateTime\":1743192226949,\"version\":2,\"type\":3,\"systemFlag\":1,\"publisherName\":\"Raiiww\",\"contentV2\":[{\"content\":\"Please be reminded that Clone accounts (duplicate accounts) are strictly prohibited on NanoGames with a zero-tolerance policy. \\n\\nAll clone accounts will be banned without notice. If a player is banned for cloning and evades the ban with a new account, the new account will also be banned without notice. The new account can still be banned even if further abuse isn't detected. A ban on an account is a ban on the player and does not expire.\\n\\nFunds from banned accounts may be confiscated to cover damages of multi account bonus abuse/affiliate fraud/etc. \\n\\nWinnings may also be voided and withdrawals denied if we find abuse from the winning account.\\n\\nThank you for your cooperation!\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":1,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false},{\"content\":\"https://img2.nanogames.io/notice/d0/e8/d3/17431911380274.png\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":3,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false},{\"content\":\"https://nanogames.io/help/agreement\",\"desc\":\"Review NanoGames User Agreement\",\"contentType\":2,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false}],\"contentV1\":null},{\"afficheId\":44,\"title\":\"Log in Captcha\",\"intro\":\"\",\"languageCode\":\"en-US\",\"createTime\":1741357576739,\"updateTime\":1741357590077,\"version\":2,\"type\":3,\"systemFlag\":1,\"publisherName\":\"Raiiww\",\"contentV2\":[{\"content\":\"We are aware of a log in issue involving captcha images not loading. This issue is not specific to any account and is site-wide. We appreciate your patience while we work to get this resolved.\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":1,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false}],\"contentV1\":null},{\"afficheId\":43,\"title\":\"Maintenance\",\"intro\":\"\",\"languageCode\":\"en-US\",\"createTime\":1739887057814,\"updateTime\":1739887062184,\"version\":2,\"type\":3,\"systemFlag\":1,\"publisherName\":\"Raiiww\",\"contentV2\":[{\"content\":\"https://img2.nanogames.io/notice/50/5a/0a/173988702477575.JPEG\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":3,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false},{\"content\":\"We will perform a scheduled maintenance tomorrow the 19th of February for approximately 30 minutes at UTC+0 2:00\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":1,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false}],\"contentV1\":null},{\"afficheId\":42,\"title\":\"Maintenance February 18 UTC+02:00\",\"intro\":\"\",\"languageCode\":\"en-US\",\"createTime\":1739799152514,\"updateTime\":1739799163418,\"version\":2,\"type\":3,\"systemFlag\":1,\"publisherName\":\"Raiiww\",\"contentV2\":[{\"content\":\"https://img2.nanogames.io/notice/56/ca/51/173979912563035.JPEG\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":3,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false},{\"content\":\"Please be aware there will be approximately 30 minutes of maintenance. Thank you!\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":1,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false}],\"contentV1\":null},{\"afficheId\":41,\"title\":\"Happy New Year!\",\"intro\":\"\",\"languageCode\":\"en-US\",\"createTime\":1735761413260,\"updateTime\":1735761416035,\"version\":2,\"type\":3,\"systemFlag\":1,\"publisherName\":\"Raiiww\",\"contentV2\":[{\"content\":\"Happy New Year from Paco - your favorite panda!\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":1,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false},{\"content\":\"https://img2.nanogames.io/notice/31/0f/97/173576134456268.JPEG\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":3,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false}],\"contentV1\":null},{\"afficheId\":40,\"title\":\"Hacked Accounts\",\"intro\":\"\",\"languageCode\":\"en-US\",\"createTime\":1735565891365,\"updateTime\":1735565928111,\"version\":2,\"type\":3,\"systemFlag\":1,\"publisherName\":\"Raiiww\",\"contentV2\":[{\"content\":\"https://img2.nanogames.io/notice/31/7b/f7/173556574070285.JPEG\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":3,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false},{\"content\":\"NanoGamers, we have seen an increase in hacked accounts and disputed withdrawals in the past week. We cannot always stop these fraudulent withdrawals, and your funds may be lost without proper account security.\\n\\nPlease remember to secure your account. Some tips to protect yourself:\\n\\n-Create a strong password, and change it periodically.\\n-Enable 2FA on your NanoGames account.\\n-Log out of NanoGames on inactive devices, and check your NanoGames logged in sessions. (Global Options). Terminate any that you don't use or don't recognize.\\n-Make sure your personal email is secure to protect against resets.\\n-Make sure your 2FA device is secure.\\n\\nHave a great week everyone!\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":1,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false}],\"contentV1\":null},{\"afficheId\":39,\"title\":\"Merry Christmas NanoGamers!\",\"intro\":\"\",\"languageCode\":\"en-US\",\"createTime\":1735183160204,\"updateTime\":1735183168958,\"version\":2,\"type\":3,\"systemFlag\":1,\"publisherName\":\"Raiiww\",\"contentV2\":[{\"content\":\"https://img2.nanogames.io/notice/85/1a/c3/173518313814377.JPEG\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":3,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false}],\"contentV1\":null},{\"afficheId\":38,\"title\":\"Withdrawal delays\",\"intro\":\"\",\"languageCode\":\"en-US\",\"createTime\":1727114944165,\"updateTime\":1727114971286,\"version\":2,\"type\":3,\"systemFlag\":1,\"publisherName\":\"Raiiw\",\"contentV2\":[{\"content\":\"https://img2.nanogames.io/notice/ea/2e/38/172711487749153.JPEG\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":3,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false},{\"content\":\"We are experiencing intermittent withdrawal delays. We expect this to be resolved today.\\n\\nAs always, funds are safe.\\n\\nThanks for your patience!\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":1,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false}],\"contentV1\":null},{\"afficheId\":37,\"title\":\"Wagering data\",\"intro\":\"\",\"languageCode\":\"en-US\",\"createTime\":1723990473043,\"updateTime\":1723990646619,\"version\":2,\"type\":2,\"systemFlag\":0,\"publisherName\":\"Raiiw\",\"contentV2\":[{\"content\":\"https://img2.nanogames.io/notice/a2/b2/0e/172399062868162.png\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":3,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false},{\"content\":\"Greetings all!\\n\\nWe are aware that wagering data may not be calculating properly for some accounts and we are actively investigating.\\n\\n\\nIn the meantime, please be kind to our NanoGames team.\\n\\nChat Moderators do not have control over site functionality, estimations on resolutions, or any pertinent backend information whatsoever. They are here to help the community with general, non-account-specific inquiries and general site assistance.\\n\\nWe ask that any account-specific issues are directed to our Live Support team. The Live Support team can help with account-specific inquiries, but they also cannot \\\"fix\\\" your account if there happens to be a site-wide bug/issue, nor can they make backend investigations move faster.\\n\\nThank you for your understanding and your patience. We will provide an update as soon as one is available.\",\"desc\":\"\",\"contentType\":1,\"sortNum\":0,\"greetings\":false,\"color\":null,\"hasBold\":false}],\"contentV1\":null}],\"sysAfficheList\":[]}}", "size":7870, "mimeType":"appli